  "description": "The first solid is a corner: three faces meeting at a point. Then the prism, twice. Round the dark sphere and the twisting tower a ring of prisms you can walk round but not through - the prism as a blocker. Past it, two structures of wedges: a bar you walk up, along and down, and a block you climb from any of four sides - the prism as a ramp, the one solid that turns a step into a slope. Last, a pen of thirty falling rocks that never pack, the irregular solid against the regular ones.",
